# Public release repo: docs + release metadata only.
# The executable ships exclusively as a GitHub Release asset, never in git.
# Whitelist approach: ignore everything, then allow the few published files.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE.txt
!CHANGELOG.md
!TRUST.md
!media/
!media/*.png
!media/*.jpg
!media/*.jpeg
!media/*.gif
